{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "多源不降级",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 80.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回到开头的节点。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.956
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "它的关键，是按来源区别对待。",
   "spoken": "它的关键，是按来源区别对待。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.34,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 3.34,
   "speechEnd": 6.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "你从别的 IP 去查，它就给你真数据。",
   "spoken": "你从别的 IP 去查，它就给你真数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 6.52,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 6.611,
   "speechEnd": 8.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "所以防线不是多看几次同一个节点，而是比对不同运营方的数据源。",
   "spoken": "所以防线不是多看几次同一个节点，而是比对不同运营方的数据源。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 9.38,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 9.472,
   "speechEnd": 15.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "第一条，多源校验。",
   "spoken": "第一条，多源较验。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 15.76,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 15.86,
   "speechEnd": 17.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "充值扫描和跨链放行，至少用两个独立来源，比如自建节点加一家第三方 RPC。",
   "spoken": "充值扫描和跨链放行，至少用两个独立来源，比如自建节点加一家第三方 RPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 18.14,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 18.234,
   "speechEnd": 25.608
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "独立要按运营方算，同一家服务商的两个节点，只算一个。",
   "spoken": "独立要按运营方算，同一家服务商的两个节点，只算一个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 26.04,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 26.139,
   "speechEnd": 30.526
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "第二条，不降级。",
   "spoken": "第二条，不降级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 30.98,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 31.076,
   "speechEnd": 32.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "节点超时后，法定数不自动下降。",
   "spoken": "节点超时后，法定数不自动下降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 32.88,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 32.976,
   "speechEnd": 35.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "达不到法定数就暂停，人工确认。",
   "spoken": "达不到法定数就暂停，人工确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 35.82,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 35.913,
   "speechEnd": 38.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "开头的事件里，干净的 RPC 被打掉，系统自动切到剩下的节点，这就是降级。",
   "spoken": "开头的事件里，干净的 RPC 被打掉，系统自动切到剩下的节点，这就是降级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 39.0,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 39.096,
   "speechEnd": 45.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "第三条，结果冲突就暂停入账，不挑一个先用。",
   "spoken": "第三条，结果冲突就暂停入账，不挑一个先用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 45.86,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 45.953,
   "speechEnd": 49.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "第四条，节点本身也要比对。",
   "spoken": "第四条，节点本身也要比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 50.08,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 50.08,
   "speechEnd": 52.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "链头要和不同网络、不同运营方的来源持续比对，对等连接也要来自不同网络。",
   "spoken": "链头要和不同网络、不同运营方的来源持续比对，对等连接也要来自不同网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 52.86,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 52.86,
   "speechEnd": 60.129
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "自建节点可以选少数派客户端，或者两种客户端互相比对，硬分叉前完成升级。",
   "spoken": "自建节点可以选少数派客户端，或者两种客户端互相比对，硬分叉前完成升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 60.6,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 60.6,
   "speechEnd": 68.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "这几条，对被替换的节点、被日蚀的节点、停在错误分叉上的节点，都有效。",
   "spoken": "这几条，对被替换的节点、被日蚀的节点、停在错误分叉上的节点，都有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 68.82,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 68.916,
   "speechEnd": 74.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "局限是，如果所有来源都接在同一个上游，数量再多也没用。",
   "spoken": "局限是，如果所有来源都接在同一个上游，数量再多也没用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 75.04,
